@baseUrl = {{host}}/api/v1
@token = {{authToken}}

### Listar facturas
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar facturas con filtros
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices?search=FAC&invoice_type=simplificada&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Detalle de factura
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices/{{invoiceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Emitir factura sobre una venta
POST {{baseUrl}}/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sale_id": "{{saleId}}",
  "invoice_type": "simplificada",
  "client_name": "Maria Gonzalez",
  "client_document": "001-120390-1000A",
  "client_address": null,
  "client_phone": "8888-1000",
  "client_email": "maria.demo@test.com"
}

### Anular factura
POST {{baseUrl}}/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Error de facturacion"
}
